    "text": "De Alleluia, and hwanan he come.\nHwa cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00e6rest Alleluia? Responsio, Dauid.\nOn hwilcere \u00f0eode cw\u00e6\u00f0 he hit? Responsio, On ebreisc.\nHw\u00e6r cw\u00e6\u00f0 he hine \u00e6rest? Betwux twam dunum, \u00f0a hattan Tabor and ermon.\nHw\u00e6t bi\u00f0 hit on ure leden? Alle, Saluum, lu, Me fac, la, Domine.\nHw\u00e6t bi\u00f0 hit on ure ge\u00f0eode? Responsio, Hit bi\u00f0, geh\u00e6le me, drihten.\nAnd Hieronimus cw\u00e6\u00f0, Alle, Miserere, lu, Nobis, Ia, Domine.\nHw\u00e6t bi\u00f0 hit on ure leden? Responsio, Hit bi\u00f0, miltsa us, Drihten.\nGregorius cw\u00e6\u00f0, Alle, pater, lu, Filius, Ia, Spiritus sanctus.\nHw\u00e6t bi\u00f0 on ure ge\u00f0eode \u00f0is? Hit bi\u00f0, Alle, F\u00e6der, lu, Sunu, Ia, Se halga gast.",
